sequenceDiagram
  actor U as Customer
  participant WA as WhatsApp
  participant WH as Express webhook
  participant BOT as Chatbot service
  participant D as Domain
  participant RS as Reservation service
  participant DB as MongoDB
  U->>WA: Choose service and time
  WA->>WH: POST /webhooks/inbound-message
  WH->>WH: Verify Vonage signature
  WH->>BOT: Payload and sender
  BOT->>D: Advance conversation state
  D-->>BOT: Options or completed DTO
  alt Conversation incomplete
    BOT->>WA: Send next interactive options
  else Reservation confirmed
    BOT->>RS: contact, service, time, language
    RS->>D: Validate input and availability
    RS->>DB: Persist reservation
    DB-->>RS: Save result
    RS-->>BOT: Confirmation or alternatives
    BOT->>WA: Send confirmation or alternatives
  end
